    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23502" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δασπλῆτις</span></b> , ἡ (voc.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πλῆτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.240
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.)), <i>horrid, frightful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεὰ δ. Ἐρινύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.234
				</span></i>
