				Theoc.
				2.14
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δασπλής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆτος</span>, ὁ, ἡ, sc. 
